{"name":"Pack Leader","hex":"#acaeb1","fetched":"2026-10-18","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"pack","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A bundle made up and prepared to be carried; especially, a bundle to be carried on the back, but also a load for an animal, a bale.","A number or quantity equal to the contents of a pack"]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put or bring things together in a limited or confined space, especially for storage or transport.","To fill in the manner of a pack, that is, compactly and securely, as for transportation; hence, to fill closely or to repletion; to stow away within; to cause to be full; to crowd into."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/pack"},{"term":"leader","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any person who leads or directs.","One having authority to direct."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/leader"}],"entries":[{"title":"Leadership","blocks":[{"text":"Leadership is the ability of an individual, group, or organization to influence, or guide other individuals, teams, or organizations. Leadership is a contested term. Specialist literature debates various viewpoints on the concept, sometimes contrasting Eastern and Western approaches to leadership, and also North American versus European approaches."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Wishnu_Wardhana_-_Opening_APEC_CEO_Summit_2013.jpg/330px-Wishnu_Wardhana_-_Opening_APEC_CEO_Summit_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leadership","wikidata":"Q484275"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Wishnu_Wardhana_-_Opening_APEC_CEO_Summit_2013.jpg/500px-Wishnu_Wardhana_-_Opening_APEC_CEO_Summit_2013.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Wishnu_Wardhana_-_Opening_APEC_CEO_Summit_2013.jp